<div class="tour-detail-hero" style="background-image: url('/assets/images/hero-silkroad.jpg');">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>9 Days Silk Road: Dunhuang to Kashgar</h1>
    <div class="route">📍 Dunhuang → Turpan → Urumqi → Kashgar</div>
    <div class="badge-row"><span>🏛️ Cultural Explorer</span><span>⭐ 4-Star Hotels</span><span>🎓 English Guide</span><span>🚂 Train Included</span></div>
  </div>
