<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="tour-detail-layout">
  <div class="tour-detail-main reveal">
    <h2>Tour Overview</h2>
    <p>This 9-day Silk Road journey takes you from the Buddhist cave art of Dunhuang to the Central Asian bazaars of Kashgar, tracing the ancient trade routes that connected China with the West. Explore the Mogao Caves, cross the Flaming Mountains of Turpan, experience modern Urumqi, and discover the timeless charm of Kashgar's Old City. A compact yet comprehensive introduction to the cultural crossroads of the Silk Road.</p>

    <div class="highlight-box"><h3>Trip Highlights</h3><ul>
      <li>Marvel at the Mogao Caves — 1,000 years of Buddhist art</li><li>Camel ride at the Singing Sand Dunes</li><li>Visit the ancient Jiaohe Ruins in Turpan</li><li>Explore the Karez underground irrigation system</li><li>See the Tarim mummies at Xinjiang Regional Museum</li><li>Experience Kashgar's legendary Sunday Market</li><li>Wander through Kashgar Old City's maze-like alleys</li><li>Visit Id Kah Mosque, China's largest</li>
    </ul></div>

    <h2>Day-by-Day Itinerary</h2>
    <ul class="itinerary">
      <li><div class="day-badge"><strong>1</strong>Day</div><div class="day-content"><h4>Arrive in Dunhuang</h4><p>Your guide meets you at Dunhuang Airport or train station. Transfer to hotel. Evening visit to the lively Dunhuang Night Market.</p><div class="day-meta"><span>🏨 Dunhuang 4★</span><span>🍽 Dinner</span></div></div></li>
      <li><div class="day-badge"><strong>2</strong>Day</div><div class="day-content"><h4>Dunhuang — Mogao Caves &amp; Singing Sand Dunes</h4><p>Morning at the UNESCO World Heritage Mogao Caves (8 caves included). Afternoon camel ride at the Singing Sand Dunes. Sunset at Crescent Moon Spring.</p><div class="day-meta"><span>🏨 Dunhuang 4★</span><span>🍽 B/L/D</span></div></div></li>
      <li><div class="day-badge"><strong>3</strong>Day</div><div class="day-content"><h4>Dunhuang → Turpan (High-Speed Train)</h4><p>High-speed train across the Gobi Desert to Turpan. Afternoon visit to the ancient Jiaohe Ruins, a spectacular earthen city dating back 2,300 years.</p><div class="day-meta"><span>🏨 Turpan 4★</span><span>🍽 B/L/D</span></div></div></li>
      <li><div class="day-badge"><strong>4</strong>Day</div><div class="day-content"><h4>Turpan — Flaming Mountains &amp; Oasis Culture</h4><p>Visit the Flaming Mountains, Karez underground irrigation system, and lush Grape Valley. Enjoy a traditional Uyghur lunch with a local family in the vineyards.</p><div class="day-meta"><span>🏨 Turpan 4★</span><span>🍽 B/L/D</span></div></div></li>
      <li><div class="day-badge"><strong>5</strong>Day</div><div class="day-content"><h4>Turpan → Urumqi</h4><p>Drive to Urumqi (3 hours). Visit the Xinjiang Regional Museum to see the Tarim mummies and Silk Road artifacts. Afternoon at Hongshan Park for panoramic city views.</p><div class="day-meta"><span>🏨 Urumqi 4★</span><span>🍽 B/L/D</span></div></div></li>
      <li><div class="day-badge"><strong>6</strong>Day</div><div class="day-content"><h4>Urumqi — Heavenly Lake</h4><p>Day trip to Heavenly Lake (Tianchi) in the Tianshan Mountains. Scenic boat ride and hiking trails. Afternoon return to Urumqi and visit the Grand Bazaar.</p><div class="day-meta"><span>🏨 Urumqi 4★</span><span>🍽 B/L/D</span></div></div></li>
      <li><div class="day-badge"><strong>7</strong>Day</div><div class="day-content"><h4>Urumqi ✈ Kashgar</h4><p>Morning flight to Kashgar. Afternoon exploration of the Old City — lose yourself in narrow alleys, visit local craft workshops, and watch traditional bread-making at a tandoor bakery.</p><div class="day-meta"><span>🏨 Kashgar 4★</span><span>🍽 B/L/D</span></div></div></li>
      <li><div class="day-badge"><strong>8</strong>Day</div><div class="day-content"><h4>Kashgar — Sunday Market &amp; Id Kah Mosque</h4><p>Full day experiencing Kashgar's most iconic sights. Morning at the legendary Sunday Market. Visit Id Kah Mosque, Abakh Khoja Tomb, and the handicraft street. Evening farewell dinner.</p><div class="day-meta"><span>🏨 Kashgar 4★</span><span>🍽 B/L/D</span></div></div></li>
      <li><div class="day-badge"><strong>9</strong>Day</div><div class="day-content"><h4>Depart Kashgar</h4><p>Free time until your airport transfer. Your Silk Road journey concludes. Safe travels!</p><div class="day-meta"><span>🍽 B</span></div></div></li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What's Included</h2>
